@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}
<h2>@ViewData["Title"].</h2>
<h3>@ViewData["Message"]</h3>

<div class="well">
    <h4>Abstract</h4>
    <p>
        This work focuses on the technical implementation of the StoreFactory project that is 
        a part of the federal Industry 4.0 programme. It looks into the entire cycle of tailored 
        garments production from body scanning to knitting the final product, and proposes a 
        way to automate the whole process to the highest degree.
    </p>
    <p>
        Objective of this Thesis: Automating the textile production chain by joining body 
        scanners and knitting machines into a homogenous solution that implies minimal 
        human intervention and further decreases manufacturing costs of garments.
    </p>
</div>

<h3>Project Components</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Global Controller (GC) - Central management utility</li>
    <li>Converter Unit (CU) - Adjusts measurements for shrinkage</li>
    <li>Database (DB) - Stores material parameters</li>
    <li>XMLTool - Generates PPS job files</li>
</ul>
